 class=\"ufs-fcc__value is-empty\">–</span></li><li class=\"ufs-fcc__row\"><span class=\"ufs-fcc__name\">Salt</span><button type=\"button\" class=\"ufs-fcc__remove\" aria-label=\"Remove Salt from the calculation\" tabindex=\"-1\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 12 12\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\"><line x1=\"2\" y1=\"2\" x2=\"10\" y2=\"10\"></line><line x1=\"10\" y1=\"2\" x2=\"2\" y2=\"10\"></line></svg></button><span class=\"ufs-fcc__meta\">10 g</span><span class=\"ufs-fcc__money ufs-fcc__price\"><input class=\"fi-field ufs-fcc__input\" type=\"text\" inputmode=\"decimal\" autocomplete=\"off\" placeholder=\"Price\" value=\"\" aria-label=\"Price of Salt per kg\" tabindex=\"-1\"><span class=\"ufs-fcc__unit\">€/kg</span></span><span class=\"ufs-fcc__value is-empty\">–</span></li><li class=\"ufs-fcc__row\"><span class=\"ufs-fcc__name is-ufs\">MEADOWLAND Professional</span><button type=\"button\" class=\"ufs-fcc__remove\" aria-label=\"Remove MEADOWLAND Professional from the calculation\" tabindex=\"-1\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 12 12\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\"><line x1=\"2\" y1=\"2\" x2=\"10\" y2=\"10\"></line><line x1=\"10\" y1=\"2\" x2=\"2\" y2=\"10\"></line></svg></button><span class=\"ufs-fcc__meta\">200 g · 52,6 %</span><span class=\"ufs-fcc__money ufs-fcc__price\"><input class=\"fi-field ufs-fcc__input\" type=\"text\" inputmode=\"decimal\" autocomplete=\"off\" placeholder=\"Price\" value=\"4,20\" aria-label=\"Price of MEADOWLAND Professional per kg\" tabindex=\"-1\"><span class=\"ufs-fcc__unit\">€/kg</span></span><span class=\"ufs-fcc__value\">0,84 €</span></li><li class=\"ufs-fcc__row\"><span class=\"ufs-fcc__name\">Whole milk, warmed</span><button type=\"button\" class=\"ufs-fcc__remove\" aria-label=\"Remove Whole milk, warmed from the calculation\" tabindex=\"-1\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 12 12\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\"><